{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，过完年第三学期也开始了。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0670", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好困。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0671", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太非常简单扼要地说明了现状。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然每天都因为社团而来学校，但是假期还是会让人脑袋变迟钝。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……新吾，你过年期间有发生什么好事吗？”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0672", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还可以啦。隼太呢？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“完～全没有。照样睡觉度过。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0673", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以是和以前一样和平的过年假期啊。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也可以这么说吧。人啊，到了一定年纪后就不会追求刺激变化了……”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0674", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你悟道了啊。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你倒是交到可爱的女朋友，每天都有新变化吧～？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0675", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就叫你不要看远方了。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0676", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，今年也请多指教啰！”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，我才是要请你多多指教了。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ht0677", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，３年级是自由出席啊……这样一来跟美羽学姐见面的机会就减少了……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1601", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个时期，也是没办法的啊。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不会寂寞吗？平常见不到学姐……”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1602", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有那么寂寞吧。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇，你已经勾搭上其他女人了吗？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1603", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么要往那方面猜？”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是思考过你的人性后才做出的判断。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1604", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新学期才刚开始，就重温纱凪的毒舌了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确在学校里跟学姐相处的机会减少了，但是相对的，我们在其他地方见面补足。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且虽然是自由出席，但放学后推开这扇门的话──", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，两位都辛苦了～”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2067", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "pn0404", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能看到这个笑容，还说寂寞就太失礼了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……如果是美羽学姐的话被她抱也可以。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1605", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“带着那个笑容，做那～种事或这～种事……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1606", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为实际被那个这个过的人，老实说我实在不推荐。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被宠成那样，会让日常生活产生障碍的。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是被她那样笑着说“再射多一点出来”之类的话……不对，已经有被说过，真的好像要疯狂了。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾君，可以出来了吗？”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2068", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸欸！？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2069", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“快点把这个笼子搬出来啦。你过了这么久还是渣虫欸。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1607", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，笼子啊，好。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是这种感觉，要回归社会非常困难。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很危险的小熊喵，不要靠近喔～”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2070", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "pn0405", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，乖孩子乖孩子♪”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2071", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，我也要加油让学姐说我是乖孩子！", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要搬出来的不是那个笼子啦，渣虫。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "sn1608", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……距离好孩子的目标还好遥远。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，你又再忍耐了吧？”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2072", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、呃……”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好吧。既然你这么固执……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2073", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊、啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2074", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……又射了好多出来呢。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2075", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕、学姐……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“乖孩子乖孩子……”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2076", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……明明没有努力，却被说是乖孩子了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉今天连５分钟都没有撑住。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再加油一点吧我。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是说，一天比一天更厉害的学姐好可怕。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不要乱动喔，我拿卫生纸帮你擦掉。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2077", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、不好意思……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐真的很会照顾人。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只帮我剪指甲掏耳朵，甚至还帮我穿袜子。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，房间的卫生纸用完了……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2078", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我有袖珍包卫生纸，用那个擦吧。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2079", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那今天就这样……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2080", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊姆、啾、嗯嗯、啾唔、啾、嗯嗯、啾唔唔……”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "mu2081", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、学姐……嘴巴……啊啊、啊啊啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如今那个美羽学姐，居然“用嘴舔干净”这种招式都学会了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么幸福真的可以吗？", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐在社团和两人独处的时候的落差真的太惊人了。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都不知道美羽学姐的这一面吧……", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到这点，我不禁嘿嘿笑起来。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……噜……”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "pn0406", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才那是熊喵的叫声？", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么晚了发生什么事了？", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有再听到声音了，是我的错觉吗？", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之早点回去吧，樱乃会担心的……", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "pn0407", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……呜噜……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "pn0408", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
